# JooKoi Folder Memory Dinosaur — private-file marker.
# Anything prefixed _jookoi- is personal/private: never committed anywhere,
# always safe to have around. See _architecture/plans/2026-08-30-jookoi-folder-memory-dinosaur.md
#
# This is a literal, droppable file — set as your global excludesFile directly,
# or merge these lines into an existing ~/.gitignore. Either way _jookoi* itself
# stays gitignored (private); this file only controls what GIT tracks. It does
# not affect what Claude Code can read — see README.md "LLM read access" below.
_jookoi-*
